{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>And you shall eat, etc.</b> This is the second tithe. For He has already taught us to give the first tithe to the Levites, as it says ״כִּי תִקְחוּ מֵאֵת בְּנֵי יִשְׂרָאֵל וְגוֹ״ (Numbers 18) — and He gave them permission to eat it anywhere, as it says ״וַאֲכַלְתֶּם אֹתוֹ בְּכָל מָקוֹם״ (ibid. 18) — so perforce this is another tithe."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:47:05.399067167Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}